<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="512648466"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445174817"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Without You (Otto Knows Remix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Avicii / Sandro Cavazza / Otto Knows"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Without You (Remixes)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:33.493"><div begin="00:09.912" end="03:29.700"><p begin="00:09.912" end="00:13.747" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">You said that we would always be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说过我们会永远相知相守</span></p><p begin="00:13.747" end="00:17.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Without you, I feel lost at sea<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我感觉自己在汪洋大海迷失</span></p><p begin="00:17.265" end="00:20.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Through the darkness, you'd hide with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在漫漫黑夜你对我躲避不及</span></p><p begin="00:20.864" end="00:24.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Like the wind, we'd be wild and free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像风儿一样我们会狂野而自由</span></p><p begin="00:24.637" end="00:31.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">You said you'd follow me anywhere<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你</span></p><p begin="00:31.151" end="00:38.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">But your eyes tell me you won't be there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是你的眼神</span></p><p begin="00:40.420" end="00:43.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I've gotta learn how to love without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你在身边我必须学会如何去爱</span></p><p begin="00:43.933" end="00:47.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I've gotta carry my cross without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我必须学会在重压之下继续前行</span></p><p begin="00:47.706" end="00:51.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Stuck in the middle, and I'm just about to<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似乎被困迷雾中没有你在身边我要</span></p><p begin="00:52.088" end="00:55.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Figure it out without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己克服重重阻碍</span></p><p begin="00:55.284" end="00:58.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">And I'm done sitting home without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的日子里我呆呆地坐在家里就要窒息</span></p><p begin="00:58.655" end="01:02.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Fuck, I'm going out without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">管它呢没有你我独自漫步街头</span></p><p begin="01:02.498" end="01:05.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I'm gonna tear this city down without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要摧毁这座没有你的城市</span></p><p begin="01:05.946" end="01:10.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I'm goin' Bonnie n' Clyde without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我会无所顾忌</span></p><p begin="01:20.699" end="01:25.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I'm goin' Bonnie n' Clyde without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我会无所顾忌</span></p><p begin="01:31.703" end="01:34.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">(Without you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你</span></p><p begin="01:35.231" end="01:39.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I'm goin' Bonnie n' Clyde without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我会无所顾忌</span></p><p begin="01:39.681" end="01:43.446" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Now I'm runnin' away, my dear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的如今我正竭力逃避自己</span></p><p begin="01:43.446" end="01:46.848" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">From myself and the truth I fear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还有令我恐惧的现实</span></p><p begin="01:46.848" end="01:50.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">My heart is beatin' I can't see clear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心脏依旧跳动但我却看不清现实</span></p><p begin="01:50.586" end="01:54.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">How I'm wishin' that you were here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望你还在原地为我守候</span></p><p begin="01:54.324" end="02:00.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">You said you'd follow me anywhere<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你</span></p><p begin="02:00.931" end="02:08.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">But your eyes tell me you won't be there<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是你的眼神</span></p><p begin="02:08.059" end="02:12.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I've gotta learn how to love without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你在身边我必须学会如何去爱</span></p><p begin="02:12.041" end="02:15.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I've gotta carry my cross without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我必须学会在重压之下继续前行</span></p><p begin="02:15.582" end="02:19.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Stuck in the middle, and I'm just about to<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似乎被困迷雾中没有你在身边我要</span></p><p begin="02:19.864" end="02:23.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Figure it out without you (Without you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己克服重重阻碍</span></p><p begin="02:23.616" end="02:26.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">And I'm done sitting home without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的日子里我呆呆地坐在家里就要窒息</span></p><p begin="02:27.256" end="02:30.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Fuck, I'm going out without you (Without you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">管它呢没有你我独自漫步街头</span></p><p begin="02:30.559" end="02:33.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I'm gonna tear this city down without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要摧毁这座没有你的城市</span></p><p begin="02:33.880" end="02:38.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I'm goin' Bonnie n' Clyde without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我会无所顾忌</span></p><p begin="02:45.287" end="02:47.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">(Without you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你</span></p><p begin="02:55.902" end="03:00.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I'm goin' Bonnie n' Clyde without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我会无所顾忌</span></p><p begin="03:10.931" end="03:15.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">I'm goin' Bonnie n' Clyde without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我会无所顾忌</span></p><p begin="03:25.414" end="03:29.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I'm goin' Bonnie n' Clyde without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你我会无所顾忌</span></p></div></body></tt>